:''Not to be confused with [[Emperor Cat (Legend Rare Cat)]].''
'''Evil Emperor Cat''' (悪のネコ帝王, ''Aku no Neko Teiō'', '''Evil Cat Emperor''') is [[Emperor Cat (Legend Rare Cat)|Emperor Cat]], consumed by [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] power and possessed by a malevolent force. He appears in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Possessed by Evil (Merciless)|Prelude to Ruin]]. He was added in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Evil Emperor Cat
|image = E 535.png
|appearance = [[Possessed by Evil (Merciless)|Prelude to Ruin]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
Like most [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]], his great range together with his many abilities leave him to be a support unit rather than the main threat. 520 range means that almost every cat sent out to fight him will be gravely crippled with his Freeze and Curse abilities, rendering them vulnerable to the [[Capy]] and [[Oldhorn]]. Evil Emperor Cat also possesses [[Omni Strike]] with a range of -630~620 and a Lv.2 [[Surge Attack]], making his debuffs all the more difficult to avoid. However, for an Advent Boss, his DPS is surprisingly low, and it's mostly the other pushers presenting a threat.

